{"3800060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ShutEye", "steam_appid": 3800060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shuteye is a first-person psychological horror game that blurs the line between reality and delusion.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Mark, a troubled writer trapped in his memories from the past. Isolated within his home, paranoia grows with every slight disturbance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A home that should feel familiar twists into something far more sinister as someone enters uninvited.<i> An entity lurks in the dark. It hears your every move. </i>Stay quiet and move swiftly as you collect items and search for a way out, uncovering fragments of your past along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, escape is never what it seems. The more you explore, the more you’ll question whats real…<i> and what your mind wanted you to believe.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shuteye is a first-person psychological horror game that blurs the line between reality and delusion.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Mark, a troubled writer trapped in his memories from the past. Isolated within his home, paranoia grows with every slight disturbance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A home that should feel familiar twists into something far more sinister as someone enters uninvited.<i> An entity lurks in the dark. It hears your every move. </i>Stay quiet and move swiftly as you collect items and search for a way out, uncovering fragments of your past along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, escape is never what it seems. The more you explore, the more you’ll question whats real…<i> and what your mind wanted you to believe.</i></p>", "short_description": "Sleepless nights overwhelm Mar